    "title": "Bill Bryant (1947 - 2025) - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Royal Examiner ,\n8 hours ago Bill Bryant, 78, of Front Royal, Virginia, passed away on Friday, September 26, 2025, at the Blue Ridge Hospice Inpatient Care Center in Winchester, Virginia. Services will be private. Bill was born September 18, 1947, in Logan, West Virginia, the son of the late Wilbur William and Marie Rhodes Bryant. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
